#: dtime.cpp:55
msgid "Here you can change the system date's day of the month, month and year."
msgstr "Chal vos ploz candjî li djoû, moes, et anêye del date do sistinme."

#: dtime.cpp:128
msgid ""
"Here you can change the system time. Click into the hours, minutes or "
"seconds field to change the relevant value, either using the up and down "
"buttons to the right or by entering a new value."
msgstr ""
"Chal vos ploz candjî li date di l' ôrlodje do sistinme. Clitchîz so les "
"tchamps des eures, munutes ou segondes po candjî les valixhances, soeye-t i "
"avou les botons fretches, soeye-t i tot tapant ene nouve valixhance."

#: dtime.cpp:235
msgid "Can not set date."
msgstr "Dji n' sai defini l' date."

#: dtime.cpp:303 main.cpp:89
msgid ""
"<h1>Date & Time</h1> This control module can be used to set the system date "
"and time. As these settings do not only affect you as a user, but rather the "
"whole system, you can only change these settings when you start the Control "
"Center as root. If you don't have the root password, but feel the system "
"time should be corrected, please contact your system administrator."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Date & eure</h1>"
" Ci module di contrôle chal pout esse eployî po defini li date et l' eure "
"di l' ôrlodje do sistinme. Come ces apontiaedjes la n' afectèt nén "
"seulmint vos mins tos les uzeus di l' éndjole, vos n' poloz candjî "
"çoula ki cwand li cinte di contrôle di KDE est enondé pa root. Si vos "
"n' kinoxhoz nén li scret da root, mins k' vos pinsez ki l' eure ou la "
"date do sistinme divèt esse candjeyes, atôchîz l' administrateu do "
"sistinme."

#: tzone.cpp:62
msgid "Current time zone: "
msgstr "Coisse d' eureye do moumint: "

#: tzone.cpp:70
msgid "To change the time zone, select your area from the list below:"
msgstr ""
"Po candjî li coisse d' eureye, tchoezixhoz vosse redjon el djivêye chal "
"pa dzo:"

#: tzone.cpp:93 tzone.cpp:201
msgid "[No selection]"
msgstr "[Nole tchuze]"

#: tzone.cpp:152
msgid "Unknown"
msgstr "Nén cnoxhou"

#: tzone.cpp:289
msgid "Error setting new Time Zone!"
msgstr "Åk n' a nén stî tot definixhant ene nouve coisse d' eureye!"

#: tzone.cpp:290
msgid "Timezone Error"
msgstr "Aroke pol coisse d' eureye"

